# APEX dev-pg offsite backup secrets (restic -> Backblaze B2).
# Copy to /home/olares/code/apex/.env.dev-pg-offsite-backup (OUTSIDE this repo),
# chmod 600, olares-owned. Populate from the Olares Vault + your B2 console.
# NEVER commit the populated file. The scripts refuse to run while any value is a
# REPLACE_WITH_* placeholder.
#
# restic uses B2's S3-compatible endpoint. A dedicated dev-pg repo path is
# recommended; reusing the same restic password + B2 key as other lanes is fine
# (retention is tag-filtered, so lanes don't prune each other).
# example: RESTIC_REPOSITORY=s3:s3.us-west-004.backblazeb2.com/my-bucket/apex-dev-pg
RESTIC_REPOSITORY=REPLACE_WITH_s3:s3.REGION.backblazeb2.com/BUCKET/apex-dev-pg
RESTIC_PASSWORD=REPLACE_WITH_VAULT__APEX_Restic_Repository_Password
AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID=REPLACE_WITH_B2_keyID
AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=REPLACE_WITH_VAULT__APEX_Backblaze_Secret_Access_Key
# Optional tuning (defaults shown):
# RESTIC_HOST_LABEL=olares
# RESTIC_KEEP_DAILY=7
# RESTIC_KEEP_WEEKLY=4
# RESTIC_KEEP_MONTHLY=3
